# ASCII only. All lines. No exceptions.
# <type>(<scope>): <verb> <object> -- system-level, specific, 74 chars max
# All lines wrap tat 74 chars max
# e.g. feat(auth): add JWT refresh token rotation
# scope: noun -- component, module, layer, or subsystem

# *** REQUIRED BLANK LINE
# ---- MANDATORY: UUIDv7 Identifier Reference -------------------------
# MUST Every commit, without exception, must fist comment line with
# UUIDv7 custom format YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS-uuuuuu-7xxx-Nxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxx  = Ref: rfc:9562#s6.2-method3-sub-ms-clock-precision):
#   uuuuuu = microseconds = (same UUIDV7 value) expressed as  Standard UUIDv7 (RFC 9562 Section 6.2):
#   unix_ts_ms(48) | ver=0111(4) | rand_a(12) | var=10(2) | rand_b(62)
# *** REQUIRED BLANK LINE
#   Timestamp: real OS run date -u +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S-%6N (from realtimne OS clock value read, no fabrication)
#
# Narrative max 210 chars
# WHY: root cause, constraint, or technical gap this change addresses.
# WHAT: concrete changes -- components, interfaces, or behaviors modified.
# IMPACTED COMPONENTS
#   - <component>: <what changed>
#   - <component>: <what changed>

# BREAKING CHANGE: <what breaks, why, and migration path>

# Closes: #<n>                      -- auto-close issue on merge
# Ref: <type>:<id-or-path>          -- traceability, repeatable
# e.g. Ref: bug:456
#      Ref: feat:oauth-flow
#      Ref: spec:auth-api-v2
#      Ref: doc:docs/architecture/system-design.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Signed-off-by: Name <email>
# Co-authored-by: Name <email>
# Reviewed-by: Name <email>

# ---- Type Reference -------------------------------------------------
#   feat:     New feature                  (MINOR version bump)
#   fix:      Bug fix                      (PATCH version bump)
#   docs:     Documentation only
#   style:    Formatting, whitespace, semicolons (no logic change)
#   refactor: Code restructure, no bug fix or feature
#   perf:     Performance improvement
#   test:     Add or correct tests
#   build:    Build tools, deps, bundle config
#   ci:       CI workflow changes (Actions, CircleCI, etc.)
#   chore:    Housekeeping, no source or test change
#   revert:   Revert a prior commit
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
